.TH SIMLIB 3 "2026-10-23" "simlib" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
simlib \- SDL2-based 2D and 3D game, simulation and rendering library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <sl.h>
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
simlib is a C++17 game and simulation framework providing 2D drawing, input,
audio, fonts, post-processing effects, physics, resources, and Lua scripting
through a single public header. The 3D side adds meshes, PBR materials, sun and
local lights with shadows, chunked-LOD terrain, a Gerstner-wave ocean with
shorelines, atmosphere and clouds, a procedural props library, 3D control
panels, and flight and orbital dynamics on the OpenGL, Vulkan and Direct3D 12
backends.
.PP
The library is consumed through the CMake target \fBsimlib::simlib\fR. The
installed API reference contains individual section 3 pages for documented
public types, functions, and members.
.SH CONFIGURATION
For a user-local installation under \fB$HOME/opt\fR, configure an application
with:
.PP
.nf
cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH="$HOME/opt"
.fi
.PP
In the application's CMake project, use \fBfind_package(simlib CONFIG REQUIRED)\fR
and link \fBsimlib::simlib\fR.
.SH MANUAL SEARCH PATH
Add \fB$HOME/opt/share/man\fR to the \fBMANPATH\fR environment variable to
allow \fBman simlib\fR and the individual API pages to be found.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBsl_Bitmap\fR(3), \fBsl_Atlas\fR(3), \fBsl_StorageBuffer\fR(3),
\fBsl_Terrain\fR(3), \fBsl_Ocean\fR(3), \fBsl_OceanConfig\fR(3)
